{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0881"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c074): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c074.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0881"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge everyday/leisure","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/everyday__leisure.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",366],["+","My Little Pony | United States | 1980s | collect pastel ponies with brushable manes |\n| "],["=",240],["+","My Little Pony, launched by Hasbro in 1982, grew out of an earlier figurine, My Pretty Pony, created by the illustrator Bonnie Zacherle. The small pastel ponies had long manes and tails to brush and a symbol on their flank, and girls collected them by the dozen throughout the 1980s. In German-speaking countries the first ponies had names of their own, such as Schleifchen, Sausewind and Zuckerschnute. In 2010 the cartoon \"Friendship Is Magic\" gave the brand a second life and an unexpected adult fanbase, mostly men, who called themselves bronies.\n\n"],["=",335]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",338],["+","My Little Pony | USA | 1980er | Pastellponys mit kämmbarer Mähne sammeln |\n| "],["=",216],["+","My Little Pony (Mein kleines Pony), 1982 von Hasbro auf den Markt gebracht, ging aus einer früheren Figur hervor, My Pretty Pony, die die Illustratorin Bonnie Zacherle entworfen hatte. Die kleinen Ponys in Pastellfarben hatten lange Mähnen und Schweife zum Kämmen und ein Symbol auf der Flanke, und Mädchen sammelten sie in den 1980er-Jahren dutzendweise. Im deutschsprachigen Raum trugen die ersten Ponys eigene Namen wie Schleifchen, Sausewind und Zuckerschnute. 2010 verschaffte die Zeichentrickserie „Freundschaft ist Magie“ der Marke ein zweites Leben und eine unerwartete erwachsene Fangemeinde, meist Männer, die sich Bronies nannten.\n\n"],["=",329]]}]},
